      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "안나는 규정을 신경쓰는구나.",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "アンナは規則を大切にするんだね。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 45,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "네, 타운가드는 주로 같은 인간들을 상대하는 조직이니까요.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "はい。タウンガードは、主に人間を相手にする組織ですからね。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 46,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "평범한 구원단이나 용병들처럼 내키는 대로만 싸울 수는 없거든요.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "普通の救援団や傭兵みたいに、気ままに戦うわけにはいかないんです。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 47,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "BgCrash": 0.4,
      "BgCrashTime": 0.3,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitMotion": "SPECIAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "프로들은 기준을 가지고 있어야 해요!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "プロたるもの、基準をしっかり持たないと！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 48,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "예의 바르고, 전문적이고!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "礼儀正しく、プロらしく！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 49,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitMotion": "USN_UI_REST_START",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "또 만나는 모두를 체포할 수 있는 계획도 가지고 있어야 해요.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "それに、どんな相手にも対応できる逮捕プランを持っておくことが重要なんですよ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 50,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그게 인간이든, 아니면 공허체든지요!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "それが人間であろうと、<r=ヴォイドボーン>空虚体</r>であろうと、です！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 51,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "어때요? 갑자기 타운가드에 들어오고 싶지 않으세요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "どうですか？タウンガードに入りたくなってきたでしょう？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 52,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE_LOOP",
      "EmotionEffect": "FUN",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "지금 입단하시면 무료 머그컵도 드려요!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "今ならなんと、マグカップもプレゼントしちゃいます！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 53,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "모집 광고였냐…",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "勧誘だったのか…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 54,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "음? 그러고 보니…",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "ん？そういえば…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 55,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "네? 단장님?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "団長、どうされましたか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 56,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "처음 만났을 때는 수갑부터 채웠잖아?",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "初めて会った時、すぐに手錠をかけてきたけど…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 57,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitMotion": "SERIOUS",
      "EmotionEffect": "EMARK",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "앗, 그, 그랬던가요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "あっ、そ、そうでしたっけ～？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 58,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "규정대로 하는 거 맞아…? ",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "本当に規則通りだったの…？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 59,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitMotion": "USN_UI_REST_START",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "사실 그건 말이죠…!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "それが、実はですね…！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 60,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "EmotionEffect": "THINK2",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 61,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "혹시 손목 미인이라는 말 들어보신 적 없으세요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "えーっと、「手首美人」って言われたことありませんか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 62,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "아니면 수갑을 차기 위해 태어난 것 같은 팔뚝이라던가-",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "もしくは、「手錠をかけるにピッタリな腕」とかー",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 63,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "BgCrash": 0.4,
      "BgCrashTime": 0.3,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "태어나서 한 번도 들어본 적 없어!",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "言われたことないけど！"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 64,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "아코, 실례했습니다!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "これはこれは、失礼しましたーっ！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 65,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그런데 단장님, 농담이 아니라 손목 엄청 예쁜 거 아세요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "でも団長の手首って、冗談抜きですっごく綺麗ですよ？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 66,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "포인트로 손목시계 같은 거 차시면 어울릴 것 같은데~",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "腕時計とか、とってもお似合いだと思います～。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 67,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "안나는 또다시 살랑살랑 웃으며 화제를 돌렸다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "アンナはニコニコと笑顔を浮かべながら、話題を変えた。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 68,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "...정말로 의심하지 않는 거 맞겠지?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "…本当に疑ってないんだよな？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 69,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "어쨌든 안나는 타운가드 일에 대해 자부심이 상당한 모양이다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "とにかく、アンナはタウンガードの仕事にかなりの誇りを持っているようだ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 70,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "안나에 대해 조금 더 알게 된 것 같다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "彼女がどういう人物なのか、少しずつ分かってきた気がする。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "DictionaryFinalCut": true,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
